{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape The Wojak GOTY is a fun, wacky game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.poster.avif?t=1763753386\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.webm?t=1763753386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.mp4?t=1763753386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape The Wojak GOTY is a First-Person Single player 3d platformer where you TRAverse through increasingly challenging levels as fast as you can, or take your time to discover the secrets around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the original game was limited a grappling hook and speed boosts Escape The Wojak GOTY introduces a host of fresh platforming mechanics to keep the levels interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one, it's something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to the original game Escape The Wojak GOTY features more than 10 new levels with multiple endings and extensive secrets to be found plus other features like Saving, Controller support, Options, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Ten plus levels perfect for Speedrunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Responsive platforming controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Plenty of secrets to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A short but sweet ~1 Hour main campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Massive improvements over the original game in almost all areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE GOAT, THE GOAT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/8b230eaacf3a262e7e72426c055774c426f778e8.jpg"},{"name":"The museum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/0ac9ebdae31915293636ea83da35d519a916358d.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing is here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/4a92a99eb4210fa9daeebd0f67e5a316cce66e16.jpg"},{"name":"One must imagine Sisyphus happy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/1afb361296a96bdf0f1f309d3fffd7cd4e50f225.jpg"},{"name":"No","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/2fb6d4c1ed4d328d0f299c88955a682bb1c5cebc.jpg"},{"name":"oops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/58108120421eb420c0590a340631bfda9ff4bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"wojalobster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/4d21da42c21f485d2682568d43c9403f85dc29c6.jpg"},{"name":"You are a winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/301fb28b60b9d9897c958e87c9843addd8a061e2.jpg"},{"name":"go fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4109830/33c950c5f222181e205f89ea9d5b5845d45ffd22.jpg"},{"name":"oh it's over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publ